    {
      "number": 4,
      "pali": "“Dasayimāni, bhikkhave, kasiṇāyatanāni. ",
      "english": "“Mendicants, there are these ten universal dimensions of meditation. "
    },
    {
      "number": 5,
      "pali": "Katamāni dasa? ",
      "english": "What ten? "
    },
    {
      "number": 6,
      "pali": "Pathavīkasiṇameko sañjānāti uddhaṁ adho tiriyaṁ advayaṁ appamāṇaṁ; ",
      "english": "Someone perceives the meditation on universal earth above, below, across, undivided and limitless. "
    },
    {
